WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500
Standing light punch intentionally misses while Ryu is knocked down.

2
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.050
Luke jumps toward the recovering Ryu.

3
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.350
Luke extends jumping medium kick as Ryu rises.

4
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.800
Luke lands and blocks Ryu’s OD Shoryuken.

5
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.150
Luke remains unharmed as Ryu lands next to him.
